  features:
    tabs: 0-4 one-pixel fg protrusions on boundary (1 fg 4-neighbor, ray_len >= 3, plus side support n8>=3 or ray crosses 2*thickness-1)
    notches: 0-4 one-pixel bg dents on boundary (3 fg 4-neighbors, not adjacent to a tab)
